OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search under way after man
OL,4,Araped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped another man in Slough
OL,7,Fis being hunted by police.
OL,9,FThames Valley Police said between 01:00
OL,10,Fand 01:30 BST on Tuesday the victim,
OL,11,Fwho is in his 20s, was was approached
OL,12,Fwhile walking down the long alley just
OL,13,Fbeyond Pickford Gardens.
OL,15,FThe offender shouted at him, then
OL,16,Fexposed himself, before raping him, a
OL,17,Fspokesperson said.
