OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Liam Butler said: "We
OL,7,Funderstand an incident of this nature
OL,8,Fwill cause concern within the
OL,9,Fcommunity. This investigation remains
OL,10,Fin its early stages and we are working
OL,11,Fhard to establish the full
OL,12,Fcircumstances."
